third_party/godot-stubs/
────────────────────────
Adapted from `src/GodotStubs` of wuhao21/sts2-cli.

    Source:   https://github.com/wuhao21/sts2-cli
    Commit:   d11aa88 (fetched 2026-08-30)
    License:  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Hao Wu
    Full text: third_party/godot-stubs/LICENSE

These files are a managed no-op reimplementation of the subset of the Godot
engine's C# API surface that the Slay the Spire 2 assembly references. They
contain no MegaCrit code. They exist so the shipped game assembly can be loaded
and executed in a headless process with no graphics, audio, or input stack.

Changes from upstream are recorded in third_party/godot-stubs/CHANGES.md.
The MIT terms permit this reuse; the upstream copyright notice is preserved in
third_party/godot-stubs/LICENSE.

