Slay the Spire 2 game assemblies, localization tables, and art assets
    Copyright (c) Mega Crit Games. NOT redistributed here, in any form.
    `scripts/bootstrap.sh` copies them from the user's own legally-owned Steam
    installation into a gitignored working directory at build time. Nothing
    under build/ is ever committed. This project cannot be used without owning
    the game.

NaveGreed video footage (YouTube video OJ-6QXhNgdg and others)
    Copyright (c) the creator. NOT redistributed here, in any form — no frames,
    no clips, no stills. This repository stores only unprotectable facts read
    from the video (a seed string, a build version, an ordered list of card
    plays) together with the public video ID and timestamps that let any reader
    verify each fact against the original at its source.

Designs and concepts referenced during development
    boardengineer/RunReplays, Landmaster/Hindsight, Gennadiyev/STS2MCP —
    consulted for their command vocabularies and architectural approach. No
    code from any of them is included. See docs/dependency-audit.md.
